   "summary": "Public Law 115-123 amended section 7(m) of title 4 to add the death of a first responder working in any State, territory, or possession who dies while serving in the line of duty, and to add first responders working in the District of Columbia [2018-115-123-7-2] [2018-115-123-7-4]. It also made conforming punctuation and text changes in section 7(m), including changes in section 7(m)(2) and section 7(m)(3), and added new provisions at the end of section 7(m) [2018-115-123-7-1] [2018-115-123-7-3] [2018-115-123-7-5] [2018-115-123-7-6] [2018-115-123-7-7].",
